          "1 Peter 1:19",
          "Exodus 12:5"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "1pe-5-5",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Submission clothed in humility, grace to the lowly. First principle: humility is a garment and grace is the wage — the apron of the lowly is where God's favor lands.",
      "density": 2.0071,
      "words": 30,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 22,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "1pe-3-14",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Fearlessness commanded with Isaiah's sanctuary logic: sanctify the LORD in hearts. First principle: suffering for right is happiness's address — fear not their fear; the LORD of hosts is the sanctified dread.",
      "density": 2,
      "words": 32,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 21,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "1pe-2-22",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The Servant's sinlessness quoted in the suffering-context. First principle: Isaiah 53:9 is Peter's own credential-check on Christ — the sinless mouth is the basis of the substitution that follows.",
      "density": 1.9821,
      "words": 29,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 22,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": [
          "Isaiah 53:9"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "1pe-1-24",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The withering grass and the enduring word. First principle: Isaiah 40 is quoted whole into the apostolic age — the word preached is the word that stands forever.",
      "density": 1.9,
      "words": 28,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 21,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "1pe-4-18",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Proverbs 11:31 quoted as judgment's starting-point logic. First principle: the judgment begins at God's house — if the righteous are saved through fire, the ungodly's appearing is hopeless.",
      "density": 1.9,
      "words": 28,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 21,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": [
          "Proverbs 11:31"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "1pe-2-4",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The disallowed, chosen, precious Stone. First principle: the Stone is alive — rejected by builders, chosen by God; coming to Him is the church's building activity.",
      "density": 1.85,
      "words": 26,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 21,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "1pe-2-6",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Behold, I lay in Sion a chief corner stone, elect, precious. Textual proof: Isaiah 28:16 quoted; Psalm 118:22 in 1 Pet 2:7; same as Matt 21:42, Acts 4:11, Eph 2:20.",
      "density": 1.8357,
      "words": 30,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 19,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": [
          "Isaiah 28:16",
          "1 Peter 2:7",
          "Matthew 21:42",
          "Acts 4:11",
          "Ephesians 2:20"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "1pe-1-19",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Redemption priced in lamb-blood. First principle: the exodus lamb's inspection rules are applied to Christ — without blemish, without spot, precious beyond silver and gold.",
      "density": 1.825,
      "words": 25,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 21,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "1pe-3-12",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Ears open to prayers; the face against evildoers. First principle: the watching face is dual — over the righteous, against the evil; the same eyes, two directions.",
      "density": 1.7607,
      "words": 27,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 19,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "1pe-2-7",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The Stone divides: precious to believers, the builders' disallowance to the disobedient. First principle: the same stone generates opposite fates — honor for the believing, stumbling for the refusing.",
      "density": 1.6964,
      "words": 29,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 17,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "1pe-2-9",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Exodus 19's titles are granted to the called-out. First principle: the covenant vocation transfers to the church — darkness-exit into marvellous light for showing forth praises.",
      "density": 1.6786,
      "words": 26,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 18,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
        "citations": []
      }
    },
    {
      "entryId": "1pe-3-10",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Psalm 34's life-loving recipe. First principle: loving life begins with the tongue — refrained lips and departing-from-evil lips are the good-days precondition.",
      "density": 1.5786,
      "words": 22,
      "sentences": 2,
      "maxSentenceWords": 18,
      "gate": "PASS",
      "violations": [],
      "context": {
